    "description": {
      "title": "Godrej Alira",
      "slug": "godrej-alira",
      "metaTitle": "Godrej Alira Sector 39 Gurugram – Price & Floor Plans",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Godrej Alira in Sector 39, Gurugram, offering luxury 3, 4 & 4+ BHK apartments. Check price, floor plans, amenities, and location details.",
      "description": "Godrej Alira is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 39, Gurugram, offering premium 3, 4 and 4+ BHK residences. Designed as an exclusive low-density project, the development features a striking 33-storey tower with only 132 residences, ensuring privacy and spacious living for residents. The project blends contemporary architecture with lush landscaped surroundings, palm-lined boulevards and thoughtfully curated lifestyle amenities.\r\n\r\nStrategically positioned close to Rajiv Chowk and Medanta Medicity, Godrej Alira enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-48, Golf Course Road Extension and key business districts of Gurugram. The project is surrounded by leading schools, hospitals, retail hubs and corporate offices, making it an ideal choice for professionals and families seeking a luxurious yet convenient lifestyle.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy a wide range of modern amenities including a world-class clubhouse, landscaped gardens, fitness centre, swimming pool, jogging track, and smart security systems. Spacious residences with large balconies, high ceilings and premium finishes offer an elegant living experience. With Godrej Properties’ strong brand reputation and focus on quality construction, Godrej Alira stands out as a prestigious address in central Gurugram.",
