    "description": {
      "title": "Elan Imperial Sector 82 Gurgaon Retail Shops & Luxury Mall",
      "slug": "elan-imperial",
      "metaTitle": "Elan Imperial Sector 82 Gurgaon | Luxury Commercial and Retail",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Elan Imperial Sector 82 Gurgaon offering luxury retail shops, food court, multiplex & 5-star hotel on NH-48 with high ROI and assured returns.",
      "description": "Elan Imperial is an ultra-luxury mixed-use commercial development located in Sector 82, Gurgaon, designed to redefine the retail and entertainment experience in New Gurgaon. Strategically positioned near NH-48 and well-connected to Dwarka Expressway, this landmark project brings together premium retail spaces, a 5-star hotel, entertainment zones, and fine dining under one iconic address.\r\n\r\nSpread across a prime location with excellent connectivity, Elan Imperial is surrounded by a dense residential catchment, ensuring high footfall and consistent business opportunities. The project is thoughtfully designed to offer maximum visibility to retail outlets, with high-street frontage and modern architectural elements that enhance brand presence.\r\n\r\nThis commercial destination stands out with its blend of luxury retail and hospitality, featuring one of the largest food courts in the region along with curated dining spaces and entertainment avenues. The inclusion of a 5-star hotel further strengthens its positioning as a premium lifestyle destination, attracting both local and international visitors.\r\n\r\nRetail units are available in flexible sizes ranging from 500 sq.ft to 3000 sq.ft, making it suitable for a wide range of businesses including luxury brands, restaurants, cafes, and entertainment outlets. With a starting price of ₹1.29 Cr onwards, Elan Imperial presents a strong investment opportunity backed by high appreciation potential and rental yield.\r\n\r\nWhether you are an investor looking for long-term returns or a brand aiming for a premium retail presence, Elan Imperial offers the perfect combination of location, luxury, and business growth in one of Gurgaon’s fastest-developing commercial corridors.",
