    "description": {
      "title": "Elan Miracle Sector 84 Gurgaon",
      "slug": "elan-miracle",
      "metaTitle": "Elan Miracle Gurgaon – Retail Shops on Dwarka Expressway | Price & Details",
      "metaDescription": "Elan Miracle Sector 84 Gurgaon offers premium retail shops, food court, multiplex & office spaces on Dwarka Expressway. High footfall commercial investment.",
      "description": "Elan Miracle is a premium commercial development located in Sector 84, Gurgaon, strategically positioned on the rapidly growing Dwarka Expressway. Designed as an iconic retail destination, the project brings together high-street retail, hospitality, entertainment, and office spaces in one integrated ecosystem.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.9 acres, Elan Miracle stands out with its modern architecture and thoughtfully curated layout. The project is surrounded by major road networks on three sides, ensuring excellent visibility and accessibility for businesses. Its location within a dense residential catchment enhances footfall potential, making it a strong choice for both investors and business owners.\r\n\r\nElan Miracle offers a mix of premium retail shops, double-height showrooms, food courts, fine dining restaurants, multiplex, and luxury service apartments. The presence of a 6-screen multiplex and expansive food zones ensures continuous visitor engagement, creating a vibrant commercial hub.\r\n\r\nThe project is designed to deliver a complete lifestyle experience, where shopping, dining, and entertainment seamlessly blend. With proximity to Golf Course Extension Road, IGI Airport, and major parts of Gurgaon and Delhi, connectivity remains one of its strongest advantages.\r\n\r\nElan Miracle also benefits from the credibility of Elan Group, known for delivering high-quality commercial developments. Whether you are looking to start a retail business, invest in high-street shops, or own a space in a high-growth corridor, Elan Miracle offers a well-balanced opportunity with strong future appreciation potential.",
