    "description": {
      "title": "DLF Alameda Floors Sector 73 Gurgaon",
      "slug": "dlf-alameda",
      "metaTitle": "DLF Alameda in Sector 73, Gurgaon - Price List & Floor Plan",
      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF Alameda Floors Sector 73 Gurgaon offering luxury 3, 4 & 5 BHK independent floors with basement, stilt parking & green surroundings.",
      "description": "DLF Alameda Floors is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 73, Gurgaon, along the well-connected Southern Peripheral Road (SPR). Designed for those who seek independent living with the comfort of a gated community, this project offers thoughtfully planned 3, 4, and 5 BHK independent floors with modern architecture and spacious layouts.\r\n\r\nSpread across a well-planned township, the project features tree-lined avenues, landscaped greens, and a serene environment that balances urban connectivity with peaceful living. Each floor is designed to maximize usable space and privacy, making it ideal for families looking for a premium residential upgrade.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of DLF Alameda Floors is its independent living concept. Every unit comes with dedicated covered parking, private entrances, and access via both elevators and staircases. The inclusion of basement spaces, servant rooms, and large balconies further enhances functionality and comfort.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project enjoys seamless connectivity to NH-48, <a href=\"https://www.bigcatrealty.com/city/gurgaon/dwarka-expressway\">Dwarka Expressway</a>, and Central Peripheral Road. The upcoming infrastructure developments, including the cloverleaf flyover, are expected to significantly boost accessibility and future value.\r\n\r\nResidents also benefit from proximity to top schools, hospitals, corporate hubs, and retail centers, ensuring everyday convenience. With DLF’s strong reputation and focus on quality, DLF Alameda Floors presents a reliable investment opportunity as well as a perfect home for modern urban families.",
