    "description": {
      "title": "M3M Altitude",
      "slug": "m3m-altitude",
      "description": "M3M Altitude\r\nWelcome to M3M Altitude, a new address for luxury living on Golf Course Road Extension. This is a new launch, an ultra-luxury project in Sector 65, Gurgaon. It is a high-rise project with world-class specifications and amenities. Live above the rest; a new dawn of luxury is rising.\r\n\r\nThis residential project is spread over approximately. 5 acres of land with a lush green landscape. There are 3 high-rise towers in this project. If you are looking for a high-rise project in Gurgaon, then this project is for you.\r\n\r\nIt is a RERA-approved project, and the RERA number of M3M Altitude is 48 of 2024. This residential project offers 4BHK ultra-luxury residences and penthouses. It offers only 4 units to a core to keep privacy at its best.\r\n\r\nThe size of the 4BHK apartments varies from 3755 to 4270 sq ft. Each apartment is perfectly designed with maximum efficiency, and the interior of the units is perfectly designed, which gives them a luxury and premium look.\r\n\r\nAt M3M Altitude Sector 65 Gurgaon, you get every world of convenience right at your doorstep. This project offers premium amenities for a modern and luxury lifestyle and provides comfort and convenience. It is designed by UHA London, one of the best architecture firms globally.\r\n\r\nThis project is located at the heart of Gurgaon—Golf Course Road Extension, one of the emerging and best locations in Gurgaon. If you want to live away from city hustle in lush greenery with golf-themed residences, then this will be a perfect opportunity.\r\n\r\nM3M Altitude Gurgaon is in close proximity to top corporates, educational institutes, shopping malls, hospitals, and commercial hubs. This project is well connected to Golf Course Road, Cyber Hub, Sohna Road, SPR Road, and Dwarka Expressway. It offers easy access to all the major locations in Gurgaon and Delhi-NCR.\r\n\r\nYou can reach IGI Airport within 30 minutes’ drive, 12 minutes from NH-48, and 8 minutes’ drive from Rapid Metro. This project is seamlessly connected to all the major landmarks of Gurgaon, like the DLF Cyber Hub, etc.\r\n\r\nAbout M3M Group\r\nM3M Group is a renowned real estate group in Delhi-NCR. The M3M Group has established itself as a prominent player in the industry, specializing in the development of residential, commercial, and mixed-use projects.\r\n\r\nThe M3M Group is known for its commitment to creating iconic and innovative properties that redefine modern living and working spaces.\r\n\r\nThe company works in different kinds of properties, including luxury residences, high-end commercial complexes, upscale retail destinations, and integrated township developments.\r\n\r\nIn addition to its focus on design, the M3M Group is also recognized for its commitment to quality construction and timely delivery.\r\n\r\nOverall, the M3M India continues to be a leading player in the real estate industry, known for its commitment to innovation, excellence, and customer satisfaction.\r\n\r\nWith its track record of successful projects and forward-thinking approach, the M3M Group remains poised for further growth and success in the years to come.\r\n\r\nM3M Altitude 65 Details\r\nProject Name\tM3M Altitude\r\nBuilder Name M3M Group\r\nLocation\tSector-65, Gurgaon\r\nProject Type\tLuxury Residential Project\r\nUnit Types\t4.5BHK+S & Penthouse\r\nHRERA No.\t48 OF 2024\r\nStarting Price\t8.98 Cr*\r\nProject Status\tNew Launch\r\n \r\n\r\nM3M Altitude Sector 65 Key Features\r\nPart of the Golf Estate\r\nLagoon Theme on Terrace\r\nDesign by UHA London\r\n4 to a core\r\n4 lifts in each tower\r\nClubhouse 1.5 Lacs/sq ft. 75-foot lap pool\r\nCLP Payment Plan\r\nSports Area on 1.9 acres\r\nMulti-tier security system\r\nSpacious Layouts (3755–4270 sq ft)\r\n3 high-rise towers\r\nM3M Altitude Sector 65 Gurgaon Location Advantages\r\nIt is located in Gurgaon’s most promising location.\r\nM3M Altitude is in close proximity to educational institutes, malls, restaurants, and the headquarters of multinational companies.\r\n5 minutes from Golf Course Road\r\n8 minutes’ drive from Rapid Metro Station, Sectors 55–56\r\n12 minutes’ drive to NH-48\r\n30 minutes’ drive from IGI Airport\r\nTop corporates in the vicinity like Toyota, Dell, British Airways, Huawei, and more\r\nWell-connected to SPR Road and the Dwarka Expressway\r\nM3M Altitude Sector 65 is surrounded by premium residences and IT/ITEs.\r\nA few minutes’ drive to DLF Cyber Hub, Huda City Metro Station, and other major locations like MG Road, IFFCO Chowk, etc.",
      "category": {
        "$oid": "6915a3489d7459c549c78dd1"
