      "description": "Krisumi Waterfall Residences is a premium residential project located in Sector 36A, Gurgaon, developed by Krisumi Corporation. Designed with a blend of Indo-Japanese architectural excellence, this project offers thoughtfully planned 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments with modern layouts, spacious interiors, and high-quality finishes.\r\n\r\nSet against the backdrop of rapid urban growth near Dwarka Expressway, Waterfall Residences delivers easy connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, NH-48, and major business hubs — making it ideal for both homeowners and investors.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy a host of world-class amenities and lifestyle facilities, combining luxury living with everyday convenience.",
