      "metaTitle": "The Omaxe State Dwarka | Retail Shops & Commercial Investment",
      "metaDescription": "Explore The Omaxe State in Sector 19B Dwarka, New Delhi — India’s first 5-in-1 integrated destination featuring retail, sports arena, food district, hospitality and entertainment zones.",
      "description": "The Omaxe State in Sector 19B Dwarka is a 50.4-acre commercial destination featuring retail shops, food district, sports arena and entertainment hub in New Delhi.\r\nAt the heart of the project is a world-class cricket-cum-football stadium with a seating capacity of around 30,000 spectators, making it a major venue for sporting events and large gatherings. The development also includes a multi-sport indoor stadium, a vibrant shopping district with air-conditioned corridors, and a large food district featuring numerous dining options.\r\n\r\nThe Omaxe State aims to create a dynamic lifestyle hub where visitors can shop, dine, enjoy entertainment, and attend events throughout the year. With its strategic location in Dwarka and modern infrastructure, the project is positioned as a major retail and leisure destination in New Delhi.",
