      "metaTitle": "Prestige Ocean Crest Goa | Luxury Sea View Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Prestige Ocean Crest in Dona Paula Goa offers premium 3, 3.5 & 4 BHK sea-view apartments with modern amenities near NIO Colony and Panaji.",
      "description": "Prestige Ocean Crest is a premium residential development located in the prestigious neighborhood of Dona Paula, Goa. Designed in a classical architectural style, the project offers elegant homes with expansive balconies that capture stunning sea views and refreshing coastal breezes.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 2.05 acres, the development features 106 exclusive residences thoughtfully designed for luxury living. The project offers spacious 3, 3.5, and 4 BHK apartments with modern interiors and high-quality construction.\r\n\r\nPrestige Ocean Crest provides a refined lifestyle with amenities such as a rooftop clubhouse, swimming pool, fitness center, party areas, and landscaped spaces. Located on Doctor East Borges Road opposite NIO Colony, the project offers excellent connectivity to Panaji, beaches, educational institutions, and major lifestyle destinations.\r\n\r\nWith its elegant design, sea-facing environment, and premium amenities, Prestige Ocean Crest represents a distinctive address for luxury coastal living in Goa",
