    "description": {
      "title": "3Roads Sector 70 Gurugram – Retail Shops & Commercial Spaces",
      "slug": "3roads-sector-70-gurugram",
      "metaTitle": "3Roads Sector 70 Gurugram – Retail Shops & Commercial Space",
      "metaDescription": "Explore 3Roads in Sector 70 Gurugram, an open-air retail destination offering premium retail shops, restaurants and commercial spaces with high footfall and excellent connectivity.",
      "description": "3Roads is a vibrant open-air high-street retail destination located in Sector 70, <a href=\"https://www.bigcatrealty.com/city/gurgaon\">Gurugram</a>, developed by Reach Group. Designed as a lifestyle-centric commercial hub, the project blends shopping, dining, entertainment, and community experiences into one dynamic space. Spread across approximately 2.3 lakh sq. ft. of built-up retail area, 3Roads offers a curated mix of premium retail outlets, cafes, restaurants, and lifestyle brands.\r\n\r\n\r\nStrategically positioned at the intersection of three major roads along the Southern Peripheral Road (SPR) corridor, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, NH-48, and Sohna Road. Surrounded by thriving residential neighborhoods such as Sectors 69, 70A, and 71, the development benefits from a strong catchment of over 15,000+ nearby residences, ensuring consistent footfall and strong retail potential.\r\n\r\n\r\n3Roads has quickly become a popular social and retail destination with events, live performances, weekend flea markets, and community gatherings, creating an engaging atmosphere for visitors. With over 30 national and international brands already operating and around 80% occupancy, the project provides a strong investment opportunity for businesses and investors seeking high-visibility retail spaces in one of Gurugram’s fastest-growing commercial corridors",
