      "metaTitle": "Elan Epic Sector 70 Gurugram – Luxury Retail Shops & Commercial Space",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Elan Epic in Sector 70 Gurugram offering luxury retail shops, food court, restaurants and multiplex. Prime commercial investment on SPR.",
      "description": "Elan Epic is a landmark luxury commercial development located in Sector 70, Gurugram, along the fast-growing Southern Peripheral Road (SPR) corridor. Developed by Elan Group, the project is designed as a premium high-street retail destination combining luxury retail, entertainment, dining, and leisure experiences under one iconic architectural concept.\r\n\r\nThe project stands out with its distinctive futuristic design, expansive glass façade, and immersive retail environment. Spread across multiple levels, Elan Epic features high-end retail outlets, a vibrant food court, premium restaurants, and a 5-screen multiplex, creating a complete lifestyle and entertainment hub. One of the unique highlights of the development is the presence of floating restaurants and hanging retail pods, adding a distinctive experiential retail concept rarely seen in commercial developments.\r\n\r\nStrategically located in Sector 70 on the Southern Peripheral Road, the project enjoys seamless connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, NH-48, Sohna Road, and major residential sectors of Gurugram. Surrounded by a dense premium residential catchment including Sectors 66, 67, 69, 70, and 71, Elan Epic benefits from strong consumer footfall potential.\r\n\r\nWith modern architecture, luxury retail experiences, and entertainment-driven footfall, Elan Epic is positioned as one of the most promising high-street commercial investment opportunities in Gurugram, attracting both investors and premium retail brands.",
