    "description": {
      "title": "M3M Woodshire Sector 107 Gurugram – 2, 3 & 4 BHK Apartments",
      "slug": "m3m-woodshire-sector-107-gurugram",
      "metaTitle": "M3M Woodshire Sector 107 Gurugram – Price, Floor Plan",
      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Woodshire in Sector 107 Gurugram offering ready-to-move 2, 3 & 4 BHK apartments with modern amenities, great connectivity and green surroundings",
      "description": "M3M Woodshire is a ready-to-move premium residential project located in Sector 107, Gurugram, designed to offer a serene and <a href=\"https://www.bigcatrealty.com/blog-detail/green-homes-in-gurugram\">nature-inspired lifestyle</a>. Spread across expansive green landscapes, the project features thoughtfully planned 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments with modern amenities and spacious layouts.\r\n\r\nWith over 70% open green spaces, landscaped gardens, and tree-lined surroundings, M3M Woodshire creates a peaceful living environment away from the city’s chaos while still ensuring excellent connectivity. The project is strategically located near the Dwarka Expressway and Delhi border, offering seamless access to NH-48, IGI Airport, and major business hubs of Gurugram and Delhi.\r\n\r\nResidents benefit from a wide range of lifestyle amenities including a multi-level clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, jogging tracks, and 3-tier security system. Being a ready-to-move project since 2017, it is ideal for both end-users and investors looking for immediate possession in a well-developed residential community.",
