      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Sky Suites in Sector 65, Gurugram, offering ultra-luxury 3, 4 & 5 BHK penthouses with golf course views, premium amenities and prime connectivity.",
      "description": "M3M Sky Suites is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 65, Gurugram, within the prestigious M3M Golf Estate township. Designed for elite living, the project offers limited-edition duplex and triplex penthouses with expansive layouts, premium finishes, and panoramic golf-course views.\r\n\r\nSpread across a massive 56-acre golf-themed development, Sky Suites delivers a resort-style lifestyle with a 9-hole executive golf course, world-class clubhouse, and over 100+ lifestyle amenities. These residences are crafted for exclusivity, offering spacious configurations ranging from 3 BHK to 5 BHK luxury suites, with sizes going up to 15,000+ sq. ft.\r\n\r\nStrategically located just off Golf Course Extension Road, the project enjoys seamless connectivity to NH-48, IGI Airport, Sohna Road, and major business hubs. It is also close to top educational institutions, healthcare centers like Medanta, Artemis, Fortis, and premium retail destinations.\r\n\r\nWith ready-to-move status and unmatched luxury positioning, M3M Sky Suites is ideal for ultra-HNI buyers seeking a premium address in Gurugram.",
