    "description": {
      "title": "M3M Panorama Suites Sector 65 Gurugram – Luxury 3 BHK Apartments",
      "slug": "m3m-panorama-suites-sector-65-gurugram",
      "metaTitle": "M3M Panorama Suites Sector 65 Gurugram – Price & Floor Plan",
      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Panorama Suites in Sector 65 Gurugram offering luxury 3 BHK ready-to-move suites with golf course views and premium amenities.",
      "description": "M3M Panorama Suites is an ultra-luxury residential offering located in Sector 65, Gurugram, within the prestigious M3M Golf Estate township. Designed as an exclusive low-density development, the project comprises just 36 premium suites across 3 towers, offering unmatched privacy and luxury.\r\n\r\nThese ready-to-move 3 BHK serviced suites are crafted for elite living, featuring expansive layouts, modern interiors, and panoramic views of the lush 9-hole executive golf course. The residences are thoughtfully designed to provide a perfect blend of comfort, elegance, and resort-style living.\r\n\r\nLocated on Golf Course Extension Road, the project offers seamless connectivity to NH-48, IGI Airport, Sohna Road, and major commercial hubs of Gurugram. It is surrounded by premium residential communities, retail hubs like M3M Urbana & Cosmopolitan Mall, and top healthcare institutions.\r\n\r\nWith limited inventory, prime location, and luxury positioning, M3M Panorama Suites is ideal for HNI buyers and investors looking for exclusive ready-to-move residences in Gurugram.",
