      "description": "M3M Fairway East is a premium residential development located in Sector 65, Gurugram, forming a part of the prestigious M3M Golf Estate township. Designed for luxury living, the project offers spacious 3, 4, and 5 BHK residences with panoramic views of the beautifully landscaped 9-hole executive golf course.\r\n\r\nThis low-density development is crafted with a focus on space, privacy, and modern architecture, featuring large balconies, expansive living areas, and premium interiors. With sizes ranging from approximately 3,799 sq. ft. to over 15,000 sq. ft., the residences cater to luxury homebuyers seeking exclusivity and comfort.\r\n\r\nStrategically located on Golf Course Extension Road, M3M Fairway East enjoys seamless connectivity to NH-48, IGI Airport, Sohna Road, and key business hubs of Gurugram. It is surrounded by premium residential developments, reputed schools, healthcare facilities, and commercial hubs, making it a highly desirable address.\r\n\r\nBeing a ready-to-move project, M3M Fairway East offers immediate possession, making it ideal for both end-users and investors looking for luxury residences in Gurugram.",
