      "description": "M3M 84 Market is a premium Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) commercial development located in Sector 84, Gurugram, strategically positioned along the Dwarka Expressway corridor. Designed to cater to modern businesses, the project offers a unique blend of retail shops and office spaces, making it ideal for investors and entrepreneurs.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 6 acres of land, M3M 84 Market features 75 commercial plots with sizes ranging from 70 to 150 sq. yd., offering flexibility for different business needs. The project is approved for G+4 floors with basement, allowing maximum utilization and high rental potential.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by a dense residential catchment of over 20,000+ families, and located near key landmarks like NH-48, IGI Airport, and India International Convention Centre, the project ensures strong footfall and long-term growth potential.\r\n\r\nWith high visibility, excellent connectivity, and modern infrastructure, M3M 84 Market is a strong investment opportunity for high-street retail and office spaces in Gurugram.",
