      "description": "M3M The Line Pentsuites in Sector 72, Noida is a premium commercial development offering ultra-luxury serviced apartments combined with high-street retail and world-class amenities. Designed with modern architecture and strategic location advantages, this project is ideal for both investors and end-users.\r\n\r\nThe project features elegantly designed pentsuites with sizes ranging from approximately 865 sq. ft. to 1205 sq. ft., offering panoramic city views, large balconies, and premium interiors. A highlight of the development is the expansive 50,000 sq. ft. sky club, gourmet restaurant on the 23rd floor, and premium hospitality services.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near major corporates, medical hubs, and metro connectivity, M3M The Line ensures excellent footfall and high rental yield potential. The project also includes retail shops, food courts, and studio apartments, making it a complete commercial ecosystem.\r\n\r\nWith features like high-speed elevators, 24/7 security, dedicated parking, and luxury amenities such as infinity pool, clubhouse, spa, and concierge services, it offers a sophisticated and modern lifestyle.",
