      "description": "M3M Lofts Sector 74 Gurugram is a premium mixed-use commercial development offering luxury loft-style serviced apartments designed for modern urban living. Strategically located on Golf Course Extension Road and Southern Peripheral Road, the project ensures seamless connectivity to major business hubs, NH-8, and key areas of NCR.\r\n\r\nThis ready-to-move development features iconic studio loft apartments with double-height ceilings of approximately 5.7 meters, allowing owners to create mezzanine levels and maximize usable space. The project spans 9 floors and is part of an integrated ecosystem with high-street retail, multiplex, fine dining, and entertainment options, offering a perfect live-work-play environment.\r\n\r\nThe development offers unit sizes ranging from approximately 869 sq. ft. to 1253 sq. ft., making it ideal for investors seeking high rental yields and long-term appreciation. With features like private terraces, energy-efficient glass façade, multi-level parking, and 24/7 security, M3M Lofts ensures a premium lifestyle and excellent investment potential.\r\n\r\nResidents also enjoy world-class amenities including a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, concierge services, and direct access to retail and food courts, making it a self-sustained commercial hub.",
