      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M One Key Resiments Sector 67 Gurugram offering fully furnished serviced apartments with retail hub & high rental returns. Price starts ₹82 Lakhs*.",
      "description": "M3M One Key Resiments in Sector 67, Gurugram is a premium serviced apartment development located within the well-established M3M Urbana commercial hub. Designed for modern urban lifestyles, this project offers fully furnished studio, 1 BHK, and 2 BHK serviced apartments with managed services, making it an ideal choice for both end-users and investors.\r\n\r\nStrategically positioned on Golf Course Extension Road, the project ensures excellent connectivity to NH-8, Sohna Road, and major business hubs of Gurugram and Delhi NCR. It is surrounded by corporate offices, hospitals, and educational institutions, enhancing its investment value.\r\n\r\nThe project offers unit sizes ranging from approximately 550 sq. ft. to 1050 sq. ft., with prices starting from ₹82 Lakhs*. These fully furnished apartments come with modern interiors, air-conditioning, housekeeping services, and access to retail, dining, and entertainment options within the complex.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy premium amenities such as a clubhouse, gymnasium, spa, lounge, business center, and 24/7 security. With ready-to-move-in status and a strong rental demand in the area, M3M One Key Resiments is a high-potential investment opportunity.",
