      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Sky City Sector 65 Gurugram offering premium 2 & 3 BHK apartments with modern amenities, retail hub & prime location. Price starts ₹1.5 Cr*.",
      "description": "M3M Sky City Sector 65 Gurugram is a premium residential development located on Golf Course Extension Road, offering a perfect blend of luxury living and modern convenience. The project features spacious 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed with contemporary architecture, large balconies, and high-end specifications.\r\n\r\nSpread across a well-planned township, M3M Sky City integrates residential spaces with high-street retail, ensuring a complete live-work-play lifestyle. The project is strategically positioned with excellent connectivity to NH-8, South Delhi, and major business hubs, making it highly desirable for both end-users and investors.\r\n\r\nThe development offers unit sizes ranging from approximately 1250 sq. ft. to 2000+ sq. ft., with thoughtfully designed layouts that maximize space, ventilation, and natural light.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a luxury clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, jogging track, kids’ play area, and sports facilities. The project also features a retail hub, restaurants, and entertainment zones within the premises, enhancing everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWith premium fittings, modern interiors, and a prime location in Gurugram, M3M Sky City is ideal for families seeking a high-quality lifestyle as well as investors looking for long-term appreciation and rental income.",
