      "description": "M3M Sierra 68 Sector 68 Gurugram is a premium residential project offering ready-to-move 2 BHK and 2 BHK + study apartments designed for modern living. Spread across approximately 13 acres, the development features spacious homes surrounded by lush greenery, with nearly 90% open space and beautifully landscaped central greens.\r\n\r\nThe project consists of multiple high-rise towers with thoughtfully designed layouts, ensuring ample natural light, ventilation, and scenic views of the Aravalli hills. Apartment sizes range from around 1200 sq. ft. to 1478 sq. ft., making them ideal for families seeking comfort and functionality.\r\n\r\nM3M Sierra offers a host of premium amenities including a clubhouse with terrace pool, gymnasium, jogging track, kids’ play area, tennis court, and a unique 2.5-acre lazy river feature that enhances the lifestyle experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located on Sohna Road with excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, NH-8, and major business hubs, the project ensures seamless access to schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and corporate offices.\r\n\r\nWith ready possession, modern amenities, and a prime location, M3M Sierra 68 is an ideal choice for both end-users and investors looking for long-term value and rental potential.",
