      "metaTitle": "M3M My Den Gurgaon | Price, Floor Plan & Ready to Move Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M My Den Sector 67 Gurugram offering luxury serviced apartments with premium amenities, infinity pool & high rental returns. Price starts ₹1.3 Cr*.",
      "description": "M3M My Den Sector 67 Gurugram is a premium serviced apartment project located on Golf Course Extension Road, offering a blend of luxury living and strong investment potential. Designed with modern architecture and hospitality-inspired services, the project provides fully serviced studio, 1 BHK, and 2 BHK apartments ideal for professionals and investors.\r\n\r\nThe project offers unit sizes ranging from approximately 473 sq. ft. to 1368 sq. ft., with thoughtfully designed layouts and premium interiors. Residents benefit from a fully managed lifestyle with concierge services, housekeeping, and hotel-like facilities, making it a perfect choice for rental income generation.\r\n\r\nM3M My Den features world-class amenities including an elevated infinity pool, health club, gym, spa, business lounge, and fine dining spaces. The project is part of a larger commercial ecosystem with retail and entertainment options, enhancing both convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the development offers excellent connectivity to NH-8, Sohna Road, and major corporate hubs of Gurugram, ensuring high appreciation and rental demand. The project is ready to move, making it suitable for immediate possession and income generation.",
