      "description": "M3M Flora 68 Sector 68 Gurugram is a premium residential development located on Sohna Road, designed to offer a nature-inspired lifestyle with modern luxury. Spread across approximately 13 acres, the project features spacious 2 and 3 BHK apartments surrounded by lush greenery and open spaces.\r\n\r\nThe project stands out with its unique 4-side open tower design, offering panoramic views of the Aravalli hills and ensuring ample natural light and ventilation in every apartment. With only limited units per floor, residents enjoy privacy along with a premium living experience.\r\n\r\nM3M Flora offers unit sizes ranging from approximately 1270 sq. ft. to 1635 sq. ft., making it ideal for families seeking comfort and functionality. The development includes a double-height entrance lobby, underground parking, and a podium-based clubhouse for a luxurious lifestyle.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy world-class amenities such as a swimming pool, gymnasium, spa, jogging track, kids’ play area, and landscaped gardens. With over 90% open green space and excellent connectivity to NH-8, Golf Course Extension Road, and Southern Peripheral Road, the project ensures both comfort and convenience.",
