      "description": "M3M Skywalk Sector 74 Gurugram is a premium residential development located on Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), offering luxury 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments with modern design and high-end specifications. The project is part of a mixed-use ecosystem with retail and lifestyle conveniences, ensuring a vibrant and self-sustained living experience.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 7–7.5 acres, the development features spacious apartments ranging from around 1406 sq. ft. to 2032 sq. ft., designed with maximum natural light, ventilation, and functional layouts.\r\n\r\nThe project offers world-class amenities including a 10,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, jogging track, and multi-tier security system. It also includes features like VRV air-conditioning, modular kitchens, and premium fittings for a luxurious lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, M3M Skywalk enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-8, Golf Course Extension Road, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors seeking long-term appreciation.",
