      "description": "M3M Terraces Panipat is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 36/37 within the expansive M3M City township. The project offers exclusive 3 BHK luxury floors in a Stilt + 4 configuration, designed to provide privacy, space, and modern living.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of the project is the “My Aer Lounge” concept, where every unit comes with a private terrace, allowing residents to create personalized outdoor spaces such as lounge areas, gardens, or entertainment zones.\r\n\r\nSpread across a large integrated township, M3M Terraces ensures a well-planned environment with wide roads, landscaped greens, and a 60-meter central boulevard. Residents also benefit from access to five premium clubhouses spread across approximately 2 lakh sq. ft., offering world-class leisure, fitness, and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK floors with sizes around 1735 sq. ft., designed with modern architecture, excellent ventilation, and premium finishes.\r\n\r\nStrategically located along the Delhi–Ambala corridor, the project enjoys strong connectivity to upcoming infrastructure like RRTS and industrial hubs, making it a promising option for both end-users and investors.",
