      "description": "M3M Atrium 57 Sector 57 Gurugram is a premium high-street retail development designed to offer an exceptional commercial experience with a blend of shopping, dining, and entertainment. Strategically located on Golf Course Extension Road, the project enjoys excellent visibility and connectivity, making it a prime destination for retail businesses.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 1.4–1.5 acres, the project features a well-planned layout with G+3 floors, offering retail shops, restaurants, and food courts. The development is designed with open boulevards, a central atrium, and triple-height retail shops on the ground floor, enhancing visibility and customer engagement.\r\n\r\nM3M Atrium 57 benefits from a dense residential catchment of over 50,000 families, ensuring consistent footfall and strong business potential. The project includes modern amenities such as high-speed escalators, ample parking, 24/7 security, and dedicated zones for F&B and entertainment.\r\n\r\nWith excellent connectivity to Sohna Road, NH-8, and major business hubs, along with proximity to schools, hospitals, and residential communities, M3M Atrium 57 offers a strong investment opportunity with high rental yield potential and long-term appreciation.",
