      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Forestia East in Gurgaon International City offering luxury 3 BHK apartments with forest-themed living, clubhouse & premium amenities.",
      "description": "M3M Forestia East is a premium residential development located within the expansive Gurgaon International City (GIC) township in Manesar, Gurugram. Designed with a unique forest-themed concept, the project blends modern urban living with lush green surroundings to create a serene and luxurious lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 6.46 acres within a massive 150+ acre integrated township, the project offers spacious high-rise apartments with modern architecture, excellent ventilation, and panoramic views.\r\n\r\nThe development primarily features 3 BHK luxury residences (approx. 1850–1900 sq. ft.) with premium interiors, modular kitchens, large balconies, and high-end specifications.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, sports courts, landscaped gardens, and dedicated wellness zones such as yoga and meditation areas. The project also focuses on sustainability with features like rainwater harvesting, green landscapes, and energy-efficient design.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near NH-48 (Delhi–Jaipur Expressway) and IMT Manesar, the project offers excellent connectivity to Delhi, Gurugram, and major industrial and corporate hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
