      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Capital Sector 113 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 2.5, 3.5 & 4.5 BHK apartments with golf-themed living, clubhouse & premium amenities.",
      "description": "M3M Capital Sector 113 Gurugram is an ultra-luxury residential development located on Dwarka Expressway (Northern Peripheral Road), offering premium 2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, and 4.5 BHK apartments. Spread across approximately 65 acres, the project is part of a large integrated township designed for modern urban living.\r\n\r\nThe development features high-rise towers (up to G+36 floors) with 3-side open apartments, ensuring excellent natural light, ventilation, and panoramic views of central greens and Delhi skyline.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of M3M Capital is its golf-style living experience, including a 9-hole golf course, large landscaped greens, and over 75,000 sq. ft. clubhouse offering premium leisure and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThe project offers apartment sizes ranging from approximately 1310 sq. ft. to 2298 sq. ft., catering to both mid-size and large families.\r\n\r\nStrategically located at the Delhi-Gurugram border, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to Dwarka, IGI Airport, NH-8, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
