      "description": "M3M Golf Hills Sector 79 Gurugram is a premium golf-themed residential development located on New Golf Course Road Extension. Designed to offer a resort-style lifestyle, the project features luxury 2.5 BHK, 3.5 BHK, and 4.5 BHK apartments surrounded by lush greenery and Aravalli views.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 50+ acres, the project includes high-rise towers (G+30) with spacious layouts ranging from around 1400 sq. ft. to 2650 sq. ft. The apartments are designed with modern architecture, large balconies, VRV/VRF air-conditioning, and premium interiors like Italian marble flooring.\r\n\r\nA key highlight is the golf-centric lifestyle, featuring a 12-hole executive golf course, landscaped greens, rooftop jogging tracks, and multiple clubhouses offering luxury amenities and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThe project enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-8, Dwarka Expressway, and major business hubs of Gurugram, along with proximity to schools, hospitals, and entertainment zones, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
