      "description": "M3M Crown Sector 111 Gurugram is an ultra-luxury residential development located on Dwarka Expressway, offering premium 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments with modern architecture and world-class amenities. The project is designed to deliver a resort-style living experience with a strong focus on greenery, open spaces, and lifestyle features.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 15–16 acres, the project consists of around 11 high-rise towers (up to G+31 floors) with spacious apartments ranging from about 1605 sq. ft. to 2670 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of M3M Crown is its expansive central landscape (5.5+ acres) with themed gardens, shaded walkways, and a thoughtfully designed lake, creating a serene environment within the township.\r\n\r\nThe project features a premium waterfront clubhouse, large green zones, and over 40,000–75,000 sq. ft. of lifestyle amenities including sports facilities, wellness areas, and recreational spaces.\r\n\r\nStrategically located at Sector 111, it offers excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport, and major business hubs like Cyber City and Udyog Vihar, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
