      "description": "M3M Heights Sector 65 Gurugram is a premium residential development located on Golf Course Extension Road, offering luxury 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments with modern architecture and high-end specifications. The project is part of the vibrant mixed-use development of M3M 65th Avenue, providing a perfect blend of residential, retail, and lifestyle conveniences.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 14 acres, the project features 6 high-rise towers (up to G+47 floors) with around 1200 units, designed for maximum natural light, ventilation, and scenic city views.\r\n\r\nThe apartments range from approximately 1260 sq. ft. to 2040 sq. ft., offering spacious layouts with premium specifications such as modular kitchens, air-conditioning, laminated wooden flooring, and branded fittings.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a rooftop swimming pool, jogging track, podium-level clubhouse, gymnasium, spa, kids’ play area, and multi-tier security system.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, M3M Heights offers excellent connectivity to Sohna Road, NH-8, Golf Course Extension Road, and is close to top schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
