      "description": "M3M Route 65 is a premium high-street retail development located in Sector 65, Gurugram, within the vibrant M3M 65th Avenue township on Golf Course Extension Road. Designed as a modern shopping and entertainment destination, the project offers a mix of retail shops, restaurants, cafés, and entertainment zones.\r\n\r\nSpread across a well-planned layout, the project features G+3 floors with double-height retail shops, open boulevards, and a pedestrian-friendly design that enhances visibility and customer engagement. The development is surrounded by a dense residential and commercial catchment, ensuring high footfall and excellent business opportunities.\r\n\r\nM3M Route 65 is equipped with modern infrastructure including high-speed escalators, ample parking, 24x7 security, and dedicated spaces for food courts and fine dining. Its strategic location provides seamless connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-8, and major corporate hubs of Gurugram.\r\n\r\nWith its high-street concept, premium location, and strong catchment, M3M Route 65 is an ideal investment opportunity offering strong rental yield and long-term appreciation.",
