      "description": "M3M Prive 73 is a premium high-street retail development located in Sector 73, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road. Designed as a luxury retail destination, the project blends the vibrancy of a mall with the openness of a high-street concept, creating a unique shopping and dining experience.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 8.5 acres, the project features a 5-level retail structure with lower ground, ground, upper ground, first floor, and second floor dedicated to retail and F&B spaces.\r\n\r\nThe development is designed with double-height retail shops, glass façades, and an open layout ensuring maximum visibility and seamless customer movement across levels.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of M3M Prive 73 is its architectural design inspired by London’s Burlington Arcade and crafted by UHA London, offering a world-class shopping environment with alfresco dining and landscaped terraces.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near Golf Course Extension Road, NH-8, and Sohna Road, the project enjoys excellent connectivity and is surrounded by affluent residential neighborhoods, ensuring high footfall and strong business potential.",
