      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M Urbana Premium Sector 67 Gurugram offering premium office spaces & retail shops with modern infrastructure and high footfall location.",
      "description": "M3M Urbana Premium is a premium commercial development located in Sector 67, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road. It is designed as a mixed-use project offering high-street retail shops, office spaces, and entertainment zones, creating a vibrant business ecosystem.\r\n\r\nThe project is part of the larger M3M Urbana development and features modern architecture with glass façades, double-height retail spaces, and efficient office layouts. Office spaces are typically located from the 3rd floor upwards, designed to provide a professional and productive working environment.\r\n\r\nSpread across multiple acres with a large frontage on a 60-meter-wide road, the project offers excellent visibility and branding opportunities for businesses. It also includes features like multiplex, food courts, and anchor stores to ensure high footfall and engagement.\r\n\r\nM3M Urbana Premium is equipped with modern infrastructure such as centralized air-conditioning, high-speed elevators, multi-level parking, and advanced security systems, making it ideal for corporate offices and retail brands.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near Sohna Road, NH-48, and Golf Course Extension Road, the project enjoys strong connectivity and is surrounded by residential and commercial hubs, ensuring consistent business growth and investment potential.",
