      "metaDescription": "Explore M3M IFC Sector 66 Gurugram offering Grade A office spaces & luxury retail shops with premium infrastructure on Golf Course Extension Road.",
      "description": "M3M IFC (International Financial Center) is a landmark commercial development located in Sector 66, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road. Designed as a world-class business hub, the project offers a premium mix of Grade A office spaces and luxury retail outlets.\r\n\r\nThe development features two iconic towers, including a high-rise office tower (up to 40 floors) and a dedicated retail and dining block, creating a vibrant business ecosystem.\r\n\r\nM3M IFC offers approximately 8.5 lakh+ sq. ft. of office space and around 1.5 lakh sq. ft. of premium retail space, designed to accommodate up to 10,000 professionals.\r\n\r\nRetail spaces are located on the ground, first, and second floors with triple-height frontage, large glass façades, and premium visibility, making it ideal for luxury brands and fine-dining outlets.\r\n\r\nThe project is designed by globally renowned architects (Chapman Taylor) and is LEED Gold certified, ensuring energy efficiency and sustainable infrastructure.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, M3M IFC offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and major business hubs, making it a prime investment destination with high rental yield potential.",
