      "description": "DLF The Crest is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 54, DLF Phase 5, Gurugram, one of the most prestigious addresses on Golf Course Road. Spread across approximately 8.8 acres, the project features six iconic high-rise towers designed by renowned architect Hafeez Contractor.\r\n\r\nThe project offers around 504 premium residences including 3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK apartments and penthouses, with spacious layouts, private decks, and panoramic views of the city skyline and Aravalli greens.\r\n\r\nDLF The Crest is a ready-to-move development designed with modern luxury and sustainability in mind, featuring VRV air-conditioning systems, high floor-to-floor heights, and green building standards.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities such as a luxury clubhouse, infinity-edge swimming pool, spa, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, and advanced security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity via Golf Course Road and is close to Rapid Metro (Sector 53-54), Cyber City, IGI Airport, and top schools, hospitals, and business hubs, making it ideal for elite living and investment.",
