      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF The Grove Sector 54 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 4 & 5 BHK independent floors with private terraces, clubhouse & premium amenities.",
      "description": "DLF The Grove is an ultra-luxury low-rise residential development located in Sector 54, DLF Phase 5, Gurugram, one of the most premium addresses on Golf Course Road. The project is designed to offer exclusive independent floor living with the privacy of a villa and the convenience of a gated community.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.3 acres, the development features 4 BHK and 5 BHK independent floors with sizes ranging from around 2400 sq. ft. to 5000+ sq. ft. Each building is limited to just 4 floors, ensuring low-density living and maximum privacy.\r\n\r\nEach residence is designed with premium specifications including VRV air-conditioning, home automation, high ceiling heights, large decks, and private terrace gardens. The project also offers one residence per floor concept, dedicated parking, and basement space for staff/storage.\r\n\r\nDLF The Grove focuses on nature-integrated living with landscaped greens, tree-lined boulevards, and open spaces, creating a serene environment within the city. Residents enjoy premium amenities such as a clubhouse, swimming pool, gym, spa, and multi-layered security system.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, Rapid Metro, NH-48, and major business hubs like Cyber City, along with proximity to top schools, hospitals, and IGI Airport.",
