      "description": "DLF Privana West is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 76, Gurugram, designed to offer a premium and low-density living experience. Spread across approximately 12–14 acres, the project features high-rise towers surrounded by expansive green landscapes and scenic views of the Aravalli range.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 4 BHK apartments and penthouses ranging from around 3500 sq. ft. to 5500 sq. ft., designed with large balconies, high ceilings, and modern layouts to maximize space and natural light.\r\n\r\nDLF Privana West emphasizes low-density living with limited units per acre and over 80% open green spaces, ensuring privacy, comfort, and a serene environment.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities such as a grand clubhouse, infinity-edge swimming pool, fitness zones, spa, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, and multi-layer security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near NH-48, Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), and Dwarka Expressway, the project offers excellent connectivity to Cyber City, IGI Airport, and major business hubs, making it a strong option for luxury living and investment.",
