      "metaTitle": "DLF Privana South Gurgaon | Price, Floor Plan & Luxury Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF Privana South Sector 77 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 4 BHK apartments & penthouses with Aravalli views and premium amenities.",
      "description": "DLF Privana South is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 77, Gurugram, designed to offer a low-density and premium lifestyle amidst expansive greenery. The project is part of the larger DLF Privana township and spans approximately 25 acres with over 80% open green spaces.\r\n\r\nThe development features 7 high-rise towers with around 1100+ luxury residences, offering spacious 4 BHK apartments and penthouses. Each tower is designed with only four apartments per floor, ensuring privacy and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nApartment sizes range from approximately 3577 sq. ft. to 5472 sq. ft., featuring large balconies, high ceilings, premium interiors, and panoramic views of the Aravalli hills.\r\n\r\nThe project offers world-class amenities including a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, and multi-layer security systems, delivering a resort-style living experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near NH-48, Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), and Dwarka Expressway, DLF Privana South provides excellent connectivity to Cyber City, IGI Airport, and major commercial hubs of Gurugram, making it a strong investment option.",
