      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF The Arbour Sector 63 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 4 BHK apartments with large decks, clubhouse & premium amenities.",
      "description": "DLF The Arbour is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 63, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road, offering premium 4 BHK residences designed for elite living.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 25–26 acres, the project features 5 high-rise towers (up to G+39 floors) with around 1100+ exclusive residences, ensuring low-density living and enhanced privacy.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 4 BHK apartments of around 3950 sq. ft., designed with large decks, high ceilings, and two-side open layouts for maximum natural light and ventilation.\r\n\r\nA key highlight is the massive 1.25 lakh sq. ft. clubhouse, one of the largest in Gurugram, along with 85% open green spaces, landscaped gardens, and premium wellness amenities.\r\n\r\nThe project is equipped with advanced features such as home automation, VRV air-conditioning, multi-layer security, and high-speed elevators, ensuring a modern and luxurious lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, NH-48, Rapid Metro, and major hubs like Cyber City and IGI Airport, making it a prime choice for luxury living and investment.",
