      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF Privana North Sector 76 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 4 BHK apartments & penthouses with premium amenities and Aravalli views.",
      "description": "DLF Privana North is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 76, Gurugram, and is part of the expansive DLF Privana township. The project is designed to offer a premium, low-density lifestyle with a strong focus on open green spaces and modern living.\r\n\r\nSpread across a large land parcel, the development features high-rise towers with spacious 4 BHK apartments and penthouses. The residences are thoughtfully designed with large balconies, private lift lobbies, and wide decks offering panoramic views of the Aravalli hills.\r\n\r\nDLF Privana North offers large-format homes with sizes ranging from approximately 3900 sq. ft. to over 7700 sq. ft., ensuring luxury, comfort, and exclusivity. The project emphasizes low-density living with fewer apartments per floor and a high percentage of open spaces.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy world-class amenities such as a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, fitness center, landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, and advanced multi-layer security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity to NH-48, Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), and Dwarka Expressway, providing seamless access to Cyber City, IGI Airport, and major commercial hubs of Gurugram.",
