      "description": "DLF The Ultima is a premium residential development located in Sector 81, Gurugram, within the well-planned DLF Garden City township. Spread across approximately 22 acres, the project offers a blend of luxury living and natural surroundings with vast green landscapes and water features.\r\n\r\nThe project features high-rise towers offering spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments designed with large balconies, modern interiors, and excellent ventilation. Unit sizes typically range from around 2100 sq. ft. to over 3000 sq. ft., catering to upscale family living.\r\n\r\nDLF The Ultima emphasizes a resort-style lifestyle with landscaped gardens, water bodies, and over 400+ hectares of surrounding reserved greens, creating a peaceful and eco-friendly environment.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a luxury clubhouse, swimming pools, gymnasium, sports courts, jogging tracks, and community retail spaces within the township.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity to NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, and major business hubs, along with proximity to schools, hospitals, hotels, and shopping centers, making it ideal for both living and investment.",
