      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF The Camellias Sector 42 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury apartments & penthouses with golf course views and world-class amenities.",
      "description": "DLF The Camellias is one of India’s most ultra-luxury residential developments, located in Sector 42, Gurugram, on the prestigious Golf Course Road. Spread across approximately 17.5 acres, the project offers an elite lifestyle with only 429 exclusive residences, ensuring privacy and low-density living.\r\n\r\nThe project features high-rise towers (up to 38 floors) offering spacious 4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK apartments and penthouses, with sizes ranging from around 7,400 sq. ft. to over 16,000 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nDLF The Camellias is India’s first LEED Platinum-certified residential project, emphasizing sustainability along with luxury. It offers expansive green landscapes, golf course views, and world-class architecture.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy unmatched amenities including a massive luxury clubhouse, wellness spa, swimming pools, fitness centers, concierge services, and curated lifestyle experiences, making it a benchmark for ultra-premium living in India.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers seamless connectivity to Golf Course Road, Rapid Metro, Cyber City, and IGI Airport, along with proximity to top schools, hospitals, and business hubs.",
