      "description": "DLF The Magnolias is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 42, Gurugram, on the prestigious Golf Course Road. Spread across approximately 22 acres, the project offers an elite and low-density lifestyle with premium residences overlooking the golf course and Aravalli greens.\r\n\r\nThe project comprises around 19 high-rise towers (up to 25 floors) with approximately 589 exclusive apartments, ensuring privacy and spacious living.\r\n\r\nIt offers large 4 BHK and 5 BHK apartments and penthouses ranging from approximately 6400 sq. ft. to over 10,000 sq. ft., featuring private lift lobbies, large decks, and premium interiors.\r\n\r\nDLF The Magnolias is known for its world-class amenities including a luxury clubhouse, Olympic-sized swimming pool, fitness center, spa, bowling alley, and concierge services, providing a resort-style living experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, Rapid Metro, Cyber City, and IGI Airport, along with proximity to top schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs, making it one of the most prestigious residential addresses in India.",
