      "metaTitle": "DLF The Aralias Gurgaon | Price, Floor Plan & Ultra Luxury Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF The Aralias Sector 42 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury apartments & penthouses with golf course views and premium amenities.",
      "description": "DLF The Aralias is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 42, Gurugram, on the prestigious Golf Course Road. It is one of the earliest premium developments by DLF, known for its exclusivity, spacious residences, and elite neighborhood.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 22 acres with around 70% open green space, the project offers a low-density living environment with scenic views of the golf course and Aravalli hills.\r\n\r\nThe development consists of around 10–11 towers with approximately 250+ luxury residences, ensuring privacy and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nIt offers spacious 4 BHK apartments (approx. 5575–6000 sq. ft.) and penthouses exceeding 10,000 sq. ft., designed with private lift lobbies, large decks, and premium specifications.\r\n\r\nDLF The Aralias is a ready-to-move project completed around 2008 and remains one of the most prestigious addresses in Gurugram due to its location, legacy, and high-end lifestyle offerings.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a luxury clubhouse, swimming pool, spa, sports facilities, concierge services, and multi-layer security, delivering a resort-style living experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers seamless connectivity to Golf Course Road, Rapid Metro, Cyber City, and IGI Airport, along with proximity to top schools, hospitals, and business hubs.",
