    "description": {
      "title": "DLF Corporate Greens Sector 74A Gurugram | Premium Office & Retail Spaces",
      "slug": "dlf-corporate-greens-sector-74a-gurugram",
      "metaTitle": "DLF Corporate Greens Gurgaon | Office Space Price & Details",
      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF Corporate Greens Sector 74A Gurugram offering premium office spaces, retail shops & IT spaces with excellent connectivity and amenities.",
      "description": "DLF Corporate Greens is a premium Grade-A commercial development located in Sector 74A, Gurugram, spread across approximately 25 acres of prime land. It offers modern office spaces, retail zones, and IT spaces designed to meet the needs of corporates, startups, and growing businesses.\r\n\r\nThe project consists of multiple high-quality towers with over 1100+ office units and a total built-up area of around 3.7 million sq. ft., providing flexible workspace solutions ranging from small offices to large corporate setups.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern architecture and sustainability in mind, the development features central air-conditioning, energy-efficient systems, and LEED Gold-certified infrastructure.\r\n\r\nDLF Corporate Greens offers world-class amenities including high-speed elevators, ample parking, conference rooms, cafes, restaurants, gyms, and 24x7 security with CCTV surveillance, ensuring a productive work environment.\r\n\r\nStrategically located along NH-48 and Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), the project provides excellent connectivity to Delhi, Dwarka Expressway, IMT Manesar, and major business hubs, making it an ideal commercial destination and investment opportunity.",
