      "metaTitle": "DLF Capital Greens Delhi | Price, Floor Plan & Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore DLF Capital Greens Moti Nagar Delhi offering luxury 2, 3 & 4 BHK apartments with clubhouse, greens & premium amenities.",
      "description": "DLF Capital Greens is a premium residential development located in Moti Nagar, West Delhi, offering a modern lifestyle in a centrally connected location. Spread across approximately 33 acres, the project is designed with a focus on greenery, space, and luxury living.\r\n\r\nThe project comprises around 23 high-rise towers and offers 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from approximately 1200 sq. ft. to over 3000 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nDLF Capital Greens is known for its lush green surroundings, being adjacent to a large 100-acre DDA park, creating a peaceful environment within the city.\r\n\r\nThe development features modern architecture with spacious layouts, large balconies, and excellent ventilation, ensuring comfortable living. It also offers premium amenities such as clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, sports facilities, landscaped gardens, and multi-layer security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located on Shivaji Marg, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to Connaught Place, Karol Bagh, New Delhi Railway Station, and IGI Airport via major road networks and metro connectivity.\r\n\r\nDLF Capital Greens is a ready-to-move project, making it ideal for both end-users and investors looking for property in central Delhi.",
