      "metaDescription": "Explore Puri Emerald Bay Sector 104 Gurgaon offering premium 2 & 3 BHK apartments near Dwarka Expressway with world-class amenities and ready-to-move homes.",
      "description": "Puri Emerald Bay is a premium residential development located in Sector 104, Gurgaon, along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, the project offers luxurious 2 and 3 BHK apartments designed with modern architecture and spacious layouts.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 17 acres, the project features low-density living with a significant portion dedicated to open green spaces, landscaped gardens, and water features. The apartments are thoughtfully designed with 3-side open layouts, ensuring maximum ventilation and natural light.\r\n\r\nThe project is equipped with high-end specifications including VRV air-conditioning, modular kitchens, premium flooring, and large balconies. Residents enjoy access to top-class amenities such as clubhouses, swimming pools, gymnasium, sports courts, and wellness facilities.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, Puri Emerald Bay offers excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport, Cyber City, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
