      "metaDescription": "Explore Puri Diplomatic Greens Sector 111 Gurgaon offering ultra-luxury 3, 4 & 5 BHK apartments & villas near Dwarka Expressway with premium amenities and ready-to-move homes.",
      "description": "Puri Diplomatic Greens is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the prestigious Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, this ready-to-move gated community spans approximately 20 acres and offers a perfect blend of luxury, space, and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nThe project features around 460 premium residences including spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments along with ultra-luxury 5 BHK villas. Designed with modern architecture and high-end specifications, the homes offer large layouts, abundant natural light, and premium finishes.\r\n\r\nWith nearly 80–85% open green spaces, landscaped gardens, and water features, the project ensures a serene living environment. Residents enjoy access to a grand clubhouse (20,000+ sq.ft.), swimming pool, gym, sports facilities, and wellness amenities.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near the Delhi border, IGI Airport, and major business hubs, Puri Diplomatic Greens offers excellent connectivity and is ideal for luxury living as well as long-term investment.",
