      "description": "Puri Diplomatic Residences is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 111, Gurgaon, along the prime Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Puri Constructions, this newly launched project is designed to offer high-end urban living with modern architecture, spacious layouts, and premium specifications.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.4 acres, the project features high-rise towers with low-density planning and only a limited number of apartments per floor, ensuring privacy and exclusivity. The development offers spacious 3 and 4 BHK apartments with large balconies, servant rooms, and premium finishes such as imported marble flooring and modular kitchens.\r\n\r\nThe project is equipped with world-class amenities including a luxury clubhouse, infinity swimming pool, sports facilities, landscaped greens, and smart home features. Located near the Delhi border, it offers excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, Dwarka, and major commercial hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
