      "description": "M3M Broadway is a premium mixed-use commercial development located in Sector 71, Gurgaon, strategically positioned on Southern Peripheral Road (SPR). Developed by M3M India, the project is designed as a vibrant high-street retail and business hub combining shopping, dining, entertainment, and office spaces.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 13.21 acres, M3M Broadway features double-height retail shops, Grade A office spaces, food courts, and a multiplex, making it a complete commercial ecosystem. The project is designed with grand boulevards, open courtyards, and pedestrian-friendly plazas to enhance customer experience and maximize footfall.\r\n\r\nThe development includes multi-level retail spaces, fine dining restaurants, gaming zones, and entertainment areas, attracting both investors and businesses. Its location amid premium residential societies ensures consistent foot traffic and strong rental potential.\r\n\r\nWith excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and IGI Airport, M3M Broadway stands as a high-growth commercial investment opportunity in Gurgaon.",
