      "description": "Elan The Presidential is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 106, Gurgaon, on the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Elan Group, this premium development is designed to deliver a 7-star living experience with world-class architecture, expansive layouts, and futuristic amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 30–40 acres with nearly 75–80% open green spaces, the project offers spacious 3, 4, and 5 BHK apartments along with exclusive penthouses. Each residence is thoughtfully designed with large decks, premium interiors, VRV/VRF air-conditioning, and smart home automation.\r\n\r\nThe project features iconic high-rise towers, triple-height entrance lobbies, and a luxury clubhouse with resort-style amenities. Residents can enjoy facilities such as an Olympic-sized swimming pool, concierge services, landscaped greens, and multiple sports zones.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near the Delhi border and IGI Airport, Elan The Presidential offers excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, NH-48, and major business hubs, making it a prime choice for luxury living and high-end investment.",
