      "description": "Smartworld The Edition is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 66, Gurgaon, on Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Smartworld Developers, this iconic high-rise project is designed to redefine luxury living with contemporary architecture and world-class amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 10–13 acres, the project features premium 3.5 BHK and 4.5 BHK residences along with exclusive penthouses. The development consists of high-rise towers (up to 40+ floors) with spacious layouts, private decks, and modern interiors.\r\n\r\nThe residences are designed for elite living, offering features like private jacuzzis, rooftop infinity pool, large balconies, and smart home elements. The project emphasizes open green spaces, luxury clubhouse facilities, and resort-style living.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers seamless connectivity to Golf Course Road, NH-48, Sohna Road, and major business hubs, making it an excellent choice for high-end living and investment.",
