      "description": "Smartworld Le Courtyard is a premium high-street commercial development located in Sector 98, Noida, strategically positioned along the Noida-Greater Noida Expressway. Developed by Smartworld Developers, the project is designed as an international-style retail destination featuring a mix of fashion, dining, and lifestyle experiences.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.5 lakh sq. ft. of curated retail space, the project offers a vibrant commercial ecosystem with global brands, cafes, restaurants, and boutique stores.\r\n\r\nThe development is designed with an open-air courtyard concept, featuring wide pedestrian walkways, high-visibility retail fronts, and experiential shopping zones that enhance footfall and customer engagement.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by premium residential developments and corporate hubs, including a catchment of 50,000+ affluent families within a 5 km radius, the project ensures consistent footfall and strong business potential.\r\n\r\nWith excellent connectivity to DND Flyway, Noida Expressway, and Delhi, Smartworld Le Courtyard stands as a high-growth commercial investment opportunity with long-term rental yield potential.",
