      "metaDescription": "Explore Smartworld Orchard Sector 61 Gurgaon offering luxury 2.5 & 3 BHK low-rise floors on Golf Course Extension Road with premium amenities and modern living.",
      "description": "Smartworld Orchard is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 61, Gurgaon, along the prime Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Smartworld Developers, the project offers boutique-style independent floors designed for modern urban living.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 25 acres, the project features low-rise (Stilt + 4 floors) residences with a focus on privacy, open spaces, and efficient layouts. Each home comes with private terraces, basement spaces, and dedicated parking, offering the comfort of independent living within a gated community.\r\n\r\nThe project offers 2.5 BHK and 3 BHK luxury floors with modern interiors, VRV air-conditioning, modular kitchens, and smart home features. The development includes a large clubhouse (~20,000 sq.ft.), landscaped greens, and lifestyle amenities such as swimming pool, gym, and wellness zones.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, Smartworld Orchard enjoys excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, NH-48, and major business hubs like Cyber City and Sohna Road, making it ideal for both end-use and investment.",
