      "description": "Smartworld Gems is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 89, Gurgaon, in the rapidly growing New Gurgaon corridor. Developed by Smartworld Developers, the project offers boutique-style independent floors designed for modern, low-density living.\r\n\r\nSpread across a large township (approx. 30–60 acres), the project features 2.5 BHK and 3.5 BHK luxury low-rise floors (Stilt + 4 structure) with private terraces, basement spaces, and dedicated parking. These homes are designed to provide the comfort of independent living along with the security of a gated community.\r\n\r\nThe project emphasizes smart living with features like home automation, modular kitchens, and well-ventilated layouts. Residents also benefit from lifestyle amenities such as a clubhouse, swimming pool, jogging track, landscaped greens, and sports facilities.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near Dwarka Expressway, NH-48, and the upcoming metro corridor, Smartworld Gems offers excellent connectivity to major business hubs, IMT Manesar, and IGI Airport, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
