      "description": "Smartworld One DXP is a premium residential development located in Sector 113, Gurgaon, strategically positioned on Dwarka Expressway near the Delhi border. Developed by Smartworld Developers, this luxury project is designed to offer modern, technology-enabled living with spacious layouts and world-class amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 16 acres, the project features high-rise towers with low-density planning and expansive green areas. The development offers 3.5 BHK and 4.5 BHK apartments with large decks, smart home features, and premium specifications such as VRV air-conditioning, modular kitchens, and high-end fittings.\r\n\r\nThe project emphasizes a luxury lifestyle with a grand clubhouse, swimming pool, sports facilities, and wellness zones. Designed with 3-side open apartments, it ensures excellent ventilation and natural light.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, Smartworld One DXP provides excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, Dwarka, Diplomatic Enclave, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
