      "description": "Signature Global City 37D is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 37D, Gurgaon, strategically positioned along Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Signature Global under the Deen Dayal Jan Awas Yojana (DDJAY), the project offers independent floors designed for modern, low-density living.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 20–25 acres, the project features 2 BHK and 3 BHK luxury floors in a Stilt + 4 configuration with dedicated parking, private terraces, and well-ventilated layouts.\r\n\r\nThe homes are designed with modern interiors, modular kitchens, air-conditioning provisions, and smart layouts to maximize usable space. Residents also enjoy a wide range of amenities including clubhouse, landscaped greens, jogging tracks, swimming pool, and recreational zones.\r\n\r\nLocated in a fast-developing corridor, the project offers excellent connectivity to NH-48, Pataudi Road, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investment.",
