      "metaDescription": "Explore Signature Global Titanium SPR Sector 71 Gurgaon offering ultra-luxury 3.5 & 4.5 BHK apartments on SPR with premium amenities and high investment potential.",
      "description": "Signature Global Titanium SPR is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 71, Gurgaon, on the rapidly developing Southern Peripheral Road (SPR). Developed by Signature Global, the project is designed to offer premium high-rise living with a focus on low density, green living, and world-class amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 22.5 acres, the project features around 600+ luxury apartments across 7 towers, offering spacious 3.5 BHK and 4.5 BHK configurations with large balconies and private lift lobbies.\r\n\r\nThe project is designed with 91% open and green spaces, incorporating biophilic architecture, sky gardens, and landscaped zones to enhance lifestyle quality.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy premium features such as double-height clubhouse lobby, sky terraces, private elevator access, and high ceiling heights (~3.6m), creating a grand living experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers seamless connectivity to Sohna Road, Golf Course Extension Road, NH-48, and Dwarka Expressway, making it one of the most promising luxury residential hubs in Gurgaon.",
