      "description": "Signature Global City 81 is a premium low-rise residential development located in Sector 81, Gurgaon, in the fast-growing New Gurgaon corridor near Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Signature Global, the project is part of the Deen Dayal Jan Awas Yojana (DDJAY) and offers modern independent floors with a focus on affordability and quality living.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 11.9–12 acres, the project features well-designed 2 BHK and 3 BHK low-rise floors (Stilt + 4 floors) with dedicated parking, private terraces, and efficient layouts.\r\n\r\nThe homes are designed to maximize natural light and ventilation while offering modern specifications like modular kitchens, air-conditioning provisions, and smart layouts. Residents also enjoy lifestyle amenities such as clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped greens, and sports facilities.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, and IMT Manesar, making it a strong choice for both end-users and investors in Gurgaon’s developing residential hub.",
