      "metaDescription": "Explore Emaar DigiHomes Sector 62 Gurgaon offering smart 2 & 3 BHK luxury apartments with voice automation, premium amenities & Golf Course Extension Road connectivity.",
      "description": "Emaar DigiHomes is a premium smart residential project located in Sector 62, Gurgaon, on Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Emaar India, the project is designed to offer next-generation smart living with advanced home automation and luxury amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5–15 acres (phase-wise), the project features high-rise towers (G+32) offering 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments. These homes are 3-side open, ensuring excellent ventilation and panoramic views of the Aravalli hills.\r\n\r\nThe project is known for its voice-enabled smart home features, allowing residents to control lighting, air-conditioning, curtains, and appliances through voice commands. It also includes advanced safety systems like smart locks, video door phones, and gas/smoke sensors.\r\n\r\nEmaar DigiHomes offers around 80% open green spaces, landscaped gardens, and eco-friendly design with a GRIHA rating, creating a sustainable and luxurious living environment.\r\n\r\nWith excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, NH-48, and major business hubs, the project is ideal for both end-users and investors looking for smart luxury living in Gurgaon.",
