      "description": "Emaar Emerald Hills is a premium integrated residential township located in Sector 65, Gurgaon, along the prestigious Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Emaar India, the project offers a mix of residential plots, villas, and low-rise developments designed for luxury community living.\r\n\r\nSpread across a large land parcel, Emerald Hills is known for its well-planned infrastructure, wide internal roads, landscaped greens, and serene environment. The plotted development allows buyers to build customized homes while enjoying the benefits of a gated township with modern amenities.\r\n\r\nThe township includes parks, jogging tracks, clubhouse facilities, retail spaces, and essential infrastructure, making it a self-sustained residential community. The project is surrounded by premium developments and offers proximity to schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, Emaar Emerald Hills enjoys excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and major business hubs like Cyber City and Udyog Vihar, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
