      "metaDescription": "Explore Emaar MGF Palm Hills Sector 77 Gurgaon offering ready-to-move 3 & 4 BHK apartments near NH-48 with premium amenities and Aravalli views.",
      "description": "Emaar MGF Palm Hills is a well-established residential township located in Sector 77, Gurgaon, strategically positioned near NH-48 and close to Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Emaar India, the project is part of a larger integrated community offering a blend of modern living and natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nLaunched around 2010 and delivered in phases, the project is now ready to move, making it an attractive option for end-users looking for immediate possession.\r\n\r\nPalm Hills offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments with well-planned layouts, large balconies, and scenic views of the Aravalli hills. The development is designed with ample open green spaces, landscaped parks, and a low-density layout to ensure a comfortable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe township provides a wide range of lifestyle amenities including clubhouse, swimming pool, sports courts, jogging tracks, and recreational zones. It is a gated community with strong security infrastructure and modern conveniences.\r\n\r\nWith excellent connectivity to NH-48, IMT Manesar, and major business hubs, the project is ideal for both residential use and rental investment in New Gurgaon.",
