      "description": "Emaar Urban Oasis is a premium luxury residential development located in Sector 62, Gurgaon, along the prestigious Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Emaar India, the project is designed to offer spacious, low-density living with modern architecture and high-end specifications.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 9 acres, the project features 5 high-rise towers with thoughtfully designed 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments, including simplex and duplex configurations.\r\n\r\nThe residences are 3-side open, ensuring maximum natural light and ventilation, and are planned with only 4 apartments per core, enhancing privacy and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nEmaar Urban Oasis offers a luxury lifestyle with features such as a multi-level clubhouse, infinity-edge swimming pool, landscaped greens, and advanced home automation systems. The project emphasizes green living with large open spaces and premium landscaping.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project provides excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and key business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and high-end investors.",
