      "metaDescription": "Explore Emaar Marbella Villas Sector 66 Gurgaon offering ultra-luxury 4 & 5 BHK villas with private lift, lawns & premium amenities on Golf Course Extension Road.",
      "description": "Emaar Marbella is an ultra-luxury villa township located in Sector 66, Gurgaon, along Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Emaar India, this premium gated community offers exclusive Spanish-style villas designed for high-end, independent living.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 41–100+ acres, the project features spacious 4 BHK and 5 BHK villas with plot sizes ranging from around 267 to 500 sq. yd. and built-up areas between 5605 sq.ft. to 8120 sq.ft.\r\n\r\nThe villas are designed with Mediterranean/Spanish architecture, landscaped private lawns, and high-end interiors including imported marble flooring, walk-in wardrobes, and large living spaces.\r\n\r\nEach villa offers premium features such as:\r\n\r\nPrivate lift\r\nBasement and multiple levels\r\nOutdoor entertainment areas\r\nSeparate family lounges\r\nSpacious balconies and terraces\r\n\r\nEmaar Marbella is a ready-to-move-in community with a strong residential ecosystem, offering luxury amenities like clubhouse, spa, swimming pool, sports courts, and landscaped greens.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it enjoys excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and major business hubs, making it one of the most premium villa addresses in Gurgaon.",
