      "metaTitle": "Godrej Astra Gurgaon | Ultra Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Apartments Sector 54",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Godrej Astra Sector 54 Gurgaon offering ultra-luxury 3 & 4 BHK apartments on Golf Course Road with premium amenities and elite lifestyle.",
      "description": "Godrej Astra is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 54, Gurgaon, on the prestigious Golf Course Road. Developed by Godrej Properties, this project is designed to offer an exclusive, low-density living experience with world-class design and premium lifestyle features.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 2.76 acres, the project features 2 high-rise towers with around 151 luxury residences, ensuring privacy and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments ranging from approximately 3050 sq.ft. to 4200 sq.ft., with large balconies, premium interiors, and high-end specifications.\r\n\r\nGodrej Astra is designed with a strong focus on luxury and lifestyle, featuring a private speakeasy lounge, curated forest spaces, fine dining areas, and art-inspired lobbies, creating a unique living experience.\r\n\r\nLocated in one of Gurgaon’s most elite residential corridors, the project offers seamless connectivity to Rapid Metro, NH-48, Cyber City, and IGI Airport, making it ideal for ultra-premium homebuyers and investors.",
