    "description": {
      "title": "Godrej Zenith Sector 89 Gurgaon Luxury Apartments",
      "slug": "godrej-zenith-sector-89-gurgaon",
      "metaTitle": "Godrej Zenith Gurgaon | 2, 3 & 4 BHK Luxury Apartments Sector 89",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Godrej Zenith Sector 89 Gurgaon offering luxury 2, 3 & 4 BHK apartments near Dwarka Expressway with modern amenities and strong investment potential.",
      "description": "Godrej Zenith is a premium residential project located in Sector 89, Gurgaon, in the rapidly developing New Gurgaon region near Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Godrej Properties, the project is designed to offer modern high-rise living with a strong focus on wellness, green spaces, and lifestyle amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 14–14.2 acres, the development features 8–9 high-rise towers (G+35 approx.) with over 1300+ residential units, offering 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments.\r\n\r\nThe residences are thoughtfully designed with spacious layouts, large balconies, and modern interiors, ensuring maximum natural light and ventilation. The project emphasizes low-density planning and green living, with landscaped gardens and open spaces integrated throughout the community.\r\n\r\nGodrej Zenith stands out with its wellness-focused amenities, including yoga gardens, sports facilities, clubhouse spaces, and recreational zones, making it ideal for families and professionals.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, and Pataudi Road, along with proximity to schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs in New Gurgaon.",
