      "metaDescription": "Explore Max Estates 128 Sector 128 Noida offering ultra-luxury 4 & 5 BHK apartments on Noida Expressway with low-density living and wellness-focused amenities.",
      "description": "Max Estates 128 is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 128, Noida, along the Noida-Greater Noida Expressway. Developed by Max Estates, the project is designed with a strong focus on low-density living, wellness, and premium lifestyle experiences.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 10 acres, the project features around 268 exclusive residences across 3–4 high-rise towers (G+36), ensuring privacy with only 2 apartments per floor.\r\n\r\nThe development offers spacious 4 BHK and 5 BHK residences, with sizes ranging from approximately 2,364 sq.ft. to 5,700+ sq.ft., designed with large wrap-around decks, high ceilings, and expansive layouts.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of Max Estates 128 is its wellness-driven design philosophy, with over 70–80% open green spaces, landscaped zones, and pedestrian-friendly planning that minimizes vehicular movement at surface level.\r\n\r\nThe project includes a ~46,000 sq.ft. clubhouse, premium recreational amenities, and curated spaces for fitness, leisure, and social interaction, creating a holistic lifestyle environment.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers seamless connectivity to Noida Expressway, Delhi, Greater Noida, and major commercial hubs, making it an ideal choice for ultra-luxury homebuyers and investors.",
