    "description": {
      "title": "Max Square Sector 129 Noida Premium Office Spaces",
      "slug": "max-square-sector-129-noida",
      "metaTitle": "Max Square Noida | Grade A+ Office Spaces Sector 129",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Max Square Sector 129 Noida offering Grade A+ office spaces on Noida Expressway with green-certified design and premium amenities.",
      "description": "Max Square is a premium Grade A+ commercial development located in Sector 129, Noida, along the Noida-Greater Noida Expressway. Developed by Max Estates, the project is designed with a unique “nature meets work” philosophy, integrating modern office infrastructure with green spaces.\r\n\r\nThe project features a distinctive C-shaped architectural design, built around a ~10,690 sq.ft. central forest courtyard, creating a healthy and refreshing work environment.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 2.6 acres, Max Square offers a total built-up area of around 7.5 lakh sq.ft., with large and flexible office floor plates of about 53,000+ sq.ft., making it suitable for corporates and enterprises.\r\n\r\nThe project is IGBC Platinum certified, ensuring high standards of sustainability, energy efficiency, and employee well-being. It is designed to allow 80–90% natural daylight across office spaces, enhancing productivity and reducing energy consumption.\r\n\r\nMax Square is a ready-to-move commercial hub, housing reputed companies like NDTV and General Atomics, and offers a mix of office spaces, retail zones, and business amenities.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it enjoys excellent connectivity to Noida Expressway, Delhi, and major business districts, making it one of the most premium office destinations in Noida.",
