      "metaTitle": "Sobha City Gurgaon | 2, 3 & 4 BHK Apartments Sector 108",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Sobha City Sector 108 Gurgaon offering luxury 2, 3 & 4 BHK apartments near Dwarka Expressway with world-class sports amenities and large open spaces.",
      "description": "Sobha City is a premium residential township located in Sector 108, Gurgaon, near the fast-developing Dwarka Expressway. Developed by Sobha Ltd., the project is designed to offer a blend of luxury living and sports-centric lifestyle amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 39 acres, Sobha City is one of the largest integrated residential developments in the area, featuring multiple high-rise towers surrounded by expansive green spaces and open areas.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of the project is its 90-meter diameter cricket ground, which is a rare feature in residential communities, along with a range of professional sports facilities.\r\n\r\nThe project offers well-designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments, with modern layouts, spacious balconies, and premium construction quality, which is a hallmark of Sobha’s in-house development model.\r\n\r\nSobha City emphasizes luxury, safety, and community living, with features like grand entrance lobbies, landscaped gardens, and a wide range of lifestyle amenities including clubhouse, swimming pool, sports courts, and wellness zones.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project provides excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport, Delhi, and major commercial hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
