    "description": {
      "title": "Sobha Aranya Sector 80 Gurgaon Ultra Luxury Golf & Forest Residences",
      "slug": "sobha-aranya-sector-80-gurgaon",
      "metaTitle": "Sobha Aranya Gurgaon | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Golf Course Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Sobha Aranya Sector 80 Gurgaon offering ultra-luxury 3 & 4 BHK residences in Karma Lakelands with golf views, forest living & premium amenities.",
      "description": "Sobha Aranya is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 80, Gurgaon, within the premium Karma Lakelands eco-golf township. Developed by Sobha Ltd., the project offers a unique blend of golf-course living, forest landscapes, and eco-conscious design.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 31+ acres, the development features 5 high-rise towers (G+43 to G+46) with around 524 exclusive residences, ensuring a low-density and private living environment.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK + utility apartments ranging from ~2836 sq.ft. to 4285 sq.ft., designed with large decks, high ceilings, and panoramic views of golf greens and forest zones.\r\n\r\nA key highlight is its eco-luxury concept, with over 80–85% open green spaces, forest groves, themed gardens, and a strong focus on sustainability including solar energy and rainwater harvesting systems.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy access to a ~75,000 sq.ft. clubhouse, Olympic-size pool, wellness zones, and curated lifestyle experiences including camping lawns and nature-inspired spaces.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, and SPR, Sobha Aranya offers seamless connectivity to Delhi, Cyber City, and IGI Airport, making it ideal for ultra-luxury homebuyers and investors.",
