      "description": "Adore The Select Premia is a premium residential project located in Sector 77, Gurgaon, developed by Adore Realtech Pvt. Ltd. It offers a mix of well‑designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK apartments with modern layouts, quality construction, and lifestyle‑focused features.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfortable family living, the project emphasizes open spaces and modern design aesthetics. It’s strategically located near NH‑48 and Dwarka Expressway, providing strong connectivity to business hubs, educational institutions, hospitals, and metro connectivity.\r\n\r\nThis project balances urban convenience with peaceful living, making it suitable for both end‑users and long‑term investors.",
