    "description": {
      "title": "Riviera at AIPL Lake City Sector 103 Gurgaon Luxury Apartments",
      "slug": "riviera-aipl-lake-city-sector-103-gurgaon",
      "metaTitle": "AIPL Riviera Gurgaon | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Apartments Sector 103",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Riviera at AIPL Lake City Sector 103 Gurgaon offering luxury 3 & 4 BHK lake-facing apartments with premium amenities on Dwarka Expressway.",
      "description": "Riviera at AIPL Lake City is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 103, Gurgaon, along the rapidly growing Dwarka Expressway. Developed by AIPL (Advance India Projects Limited), the project offers a lakefront lifestyle combined with modern high-rise living and sustainable design.\r\n\r\nPhase 1 of the project is spread across approximately 5.14 acres and features 2 iconic high-rise towers (G+43 floors) with around 344–400 exclusive residences, ensuring low-density living and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments ranging from approximately 2196 sq.ft. to 3211 sq.ft., with large wrap-around balconies, cross-ventilated layouts, and premium finishes.\r\n\r\nA defining highlight is its 3.25-acre central lake and forest-themed landscaping, creating a resort-style environment within the township. The development is designed as a pedestrian-first community with zero surface vehicular movement, enhancing safety and lifestyle quality.\r\n\r\nThe project is also IGBC Platinum pre-certified, focusing on sustainability, green spaces (~75–80% open area), and wellness-driven living with meditation zones, jogging trails, and nature-inspired environments.\r\n\r\nStrategically located on Dwarka Expressway, Riviera offers seamless connectivity to Delhi, IGI Airport, Cyber City, and major business hubs, making it ideal for luxury homebuyers and long-term investors.",
