      "metaDescription": "Explore AIPL Joy Central Sector 65 Gurgaon offering high-street retail, food court & office spaces on Golf Course Extension Road with premium amenities.",
      "description": "AIPL Joy Central is a premium mixed-use commercial development located in Sector 65, Gurgaon, on the prime Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Advance India Projects Limited (AIPL), the project is designed as a vibrant retail, entertainment, and office hub.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 3.98–4 acres, the project features a G+22 high-rise structure with multiple retail levels, food courts, entertainment zones, and Grade A office spaces.\r\n\r\nThe development offers high-street retail shops on ground, first, and second floors, while the upper floors are dedicated to premium office spaces. A major attraction is the presence of a multiplex, food court, and restaurant zones, making it a complete commercial destination.\r\n\r\nWith a grand 400+ ft frontage on an 84-meter-wide road, the project ensures high visibility and strong footfall, making it ideal for retail businesses and investors.\r\n\r\nThe project also features 5-level basement parking, modern infrastructure, climate-controlled retail spaces, and seamless vertical connectivity, offering a premium business environment.\r\n\r\nStrategically located amidst premium residential developments, AIPL Joy Central enjoys excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and major business hubs, making it a high-potential commercial investment.",
