      "metaDescription": "Explore AIPL Zen Residences Sector 70A Gurgaon offering premium 2 & 3 BHK apartments with modern amenities and excellent connectivity to SPR & NH-48.",
      "description": "AIPL Zen Residences is a thoughtfully designed residential project located in Sector 70A, Gurgaon, part of the larger AIPL Peaceful Homes township spread across ~11.5 acres.\r\n\r\nThe project offers well-planned 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments, designed to provide a balance of comfort, affordability, and modern lifestyle. Unit sizes typically range from ~1262 sq.ft. to 1655 sq.ft., making them ideal for mid-segment homebuyers.\r\n\r\nZen Residences focuses on wellness-oriented living, featuring amenities such as a swimming pool, yoga spaces, landscaped gardens, and a fully equipped clubhouse (~14,000 sq.ft.).\r\n\r\nThe development incorporates eco-friendly design elements, including rainwater harvesting, groundwater recharge systems, and efficient waste management, ensuring sustainable living.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), NH-48, and Golf Course Extension Road, the project offers strong connectivity to major business hubs, schools, hospitals, and daily conveniences.\r\n\r\nWith 450+ families already residing, the project is largely operational and provides a ready community environment.",
