      "metaDescription": "Explore AIPL Rhythm Residences Sector 66 Gurgaon offering fully furnished studio & 1 BHK serviced apartments with retail, dining & rental income potential.",
      "description": "AIPL Rhythm Residences is a premium serviced apartment development located in Sector 66, Gurgaon, on Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by AIPL, the project is part of the vibrant AIPL Joy Street mixed-use complex, combining retail, dining, entertainment, and residential spaces.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 4 acres, the project offers fully furnished studio and 1 BHK service apartments, designed for modern urban living and investment purposes.\r\n\r\nThese residences are equipped with modern interiors, appliances, and hospitality-style services, including housekeeping, concierge, and room services—making them ideal for rental income and short/long-term stays.\r\n\r\nThe project stands out for its mixed-use ecosystem, with retail shops, restaurants, cafés, and entertainment zones located within the same complex, ensuring high convenience and footfall.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near Golf Course Extension Road, Sohna Road, and NH-48, it offers excellent connectivity to business hubs like Cyber City and IGI Airport, making it attractive for both end-users and investors seeking rental yield opportunities.",
