      "metaDescription": "Explore ATS Triumph Sector 104 Gurgaon offering luxury 3 & 4 BHK apartments on Dwarka Expressway with premium amenities and spacious layouts.",
      "description": "ATS Triumph is a premium residential project located in Sector 104, Gurgaon, along the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway. Developed by ATS Infrastructure Ltd., the project offers luxury 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments with spacious layouts and high-end specifications.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 12 acres, the development comprises 8 towers with around 27 floors and ~443 units, ensuring a low-density living experience.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of ATS Triumph is its low-density design with only 2 apartments per floor, providing enhanced privacy, natural light, and ventilation.\r\n\r\nThe apartments are designed with premium finishes such as imported marble flooring, wooden flooring, modular wardrobes, granite counters, and integrated air-conditioning, reflecting luxury living standards.\r\n\r\nThe project offers a resort-style lifestyle with multiple clubhouses, swimming pools, landscaped greens, and sports facilities, making it ideal for families seeking a high-end living experience.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, ATS Triumph enjoys excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, IGI Airport (~9 km), Delhi, and major business hubs, making it a strong choice for both end-users and investors.",
