      "description": "ATS Tourmaline is a premium residential project located in Sector 109, Gurugram, strategically positioned near Dwarka Expressway. Spread across approximately 10.4 acres, the project offers a low-density, gated community with modern infrastructure and lush green surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe development consists of 5 high-rise towers (G+26/27 floors) with around 400+ residential units, designed to provide spacious and well-ventilated homes.\r\n\r\nATS Tourmaline offers thoughtfully designed 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from approximately 1750 sq. ft. to 3150 sq. ft., catering to modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe project features premium amenities such as a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, landscaped gardens, jogging track, children’s play area, and multi-layer security systems.\r\n\r\nIts strategic location ensures excellent connectivity to Dwarka, IGI Airport, NH-48, and major business hubs of Gurugram, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
