      "description": "ATS Marigold is a premium residential project located in Sector 89A, Gurugram, near the rapidly developing Dwarka Expressway. Spread across approximately 11 acres, the project offers a low-density living environment with over 65% open green spaces and landscaped areas.\r\n\r\nThe development comprises 6 high-rise towers with around 428 exclusive apartments, ensuring privacy and spacious living for residents.\r\n\r\nATS Marigold offers well-designed 3 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from approximately 1750 sq. ft. to 2650 sq. ft., featuring modern layouts, large balconies, and premium specifications.\r\n\r\nThe project is ready to move and RERA approved, making it suitable for both end-users and investors looking for immediate possession.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy world-class amenities including a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, sports courts, jogging tracks, landscaped gardens, and advanced security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity to Dwarka Expressway, NH-48, IGI Airport, and major business hubs of Gurugram and Delhi.",
