      "description": "Birla Arika is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 31, Gurugram, developed by Birla Estates (Aditya Birla Group). Spread across approximately 13.2–13.5 acres, the project offers a premium low-density living experience with expansive green landscapes and modern infrastructure.\r\n\r\nThe development features high-rise towers with only 2 apartments per floor, ensuring privacy and exclusivity for residents. It offers spacious 4 BHK apartments with staff rooms, designed with large layouts, premium interiors, and wide balconies.\r\n\r\nUnit sizes range from approximately 4200 sq. ft. to 4900 sq. ft., making it ideal for luxury homebuyers seeking large-format residences.\r\n\r\nThe project emphasizes green living with over 50–70% open spaces, landscaped gardens, and central greens, creating a peaceful and premium environment.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy world-class amenities including a massive clubhouse (1 lakh+ sq. ft.), swimming pools, gymnasium, sports courts, jogging tracks, wellness zones, and advanced security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near NH-48, the project offers seamless connectivity to Cyber City, Golf Course Road, IGI Airport, and major commercial hubs of Gurugram and Delhi, making it an excellent option for both end-users and investors.",
