      "metaDescription": "Explore Birla Navya Sector 63A Gurugram offering premium 3 & 4 BHK low-rise floors with modern amenities and green surroundings.",
      "description": "Birla Navya is a premium residential township located in Sector 63A, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Birla Estates, the project is designed as a low-rise, community-focused development offering a blend of modern living and green open spaces.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 47 acres, Birla Navya offers independent floors with a focus on privacy, community living, and sustainable design. The project is divided into phases like Amoda, Drisha, Vanya, and Avik, each offering thoughtfully planned residences.\r\n\r\nThe development features low-rise buildings (G+4 floors) with spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK homes ranging from approximately 1900 sq. ft. to 3700 sq. ft. These homes come with private terraces, basements, and dedicated parking spaces.\r\n\r\nBirla Navya emphasizes a green lifestyle with landscaped gardens, central greens, and themed open spaces, providing a peaceful and healthy living environment.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, jogging track, sports courts, kids’ play areas, and advanced security systems.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, the project offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, Sohna Road, NH-48, and major commercial hubs like Cyber City and IGI Airport, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
