      "metaDescription": "Explore Birla Navya Amoda Sector 63A Gurugram offering premium 2, 3 & 4 BHK low-rise floors with modern amenities and green living.",
      "description": "Birla Navya Amoda is the first phase of the premium Birla Navya township located in Sector 63A, Gurugram, on Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Birla Estates, the project is designed to offer a low-rise, community-focused lifestyle with modern infrastructure and abundant greenery.\r\n\r\nSpread across part of a large ~47-acre township, Amoda I & II form the initial residential clusters, offering a gated and secure living environment with multi-tier security systems.\r\n\r\nThe project features low-rise independent floors (basement + stilt + 4 floors + terrace), ensuring privacy while maintaining a strong sense of community living.\r\n\r\nBirla Navya Amoda offers 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK residences with sizes ranging approximately from 900 sq. ft. to over 3800 sq. ft., designed with spacious layouts, balconies, and natural ventilation.\r\n\r\nThe project emphasizes sustainable and green living with IGBC Gold pre-certification, landscaped gardens, and eco-friendly infrastructure.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy world-class amenities including a massive clubhouse (~1.5 lakh sq. ft.), swimming pool, sports courts, jogging tracks, kids’ play areas, and community spaces designed for social interaction.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, Birla Navya Amoda offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Extension Road, NH-48, Sohna Road, and major hubs like Cyber City and IGI Airport, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
