    "description": {
      "title": "Central Park Delphine Sector 104 Gurugram | Ultra Luxury Studio, 1, 3 & 4 BHK Residences",
      "slug": "central-park-delphine-sector-104-gurugram",
      "metaTitle": "Central Park Delphine Gurgaon | Price, Floor Plan & Luxury Apartments",
      "metaDescription": "Explore Central Park Delphine Sector 104 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury studio, 1, 3 & 4 BHK residences on Dwarka Expressway.",
      "description": "Central Park Delphine is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 104, Gurugram, along the fast-growing Dwarka Expressway corridor. The project is designed to offer a premium lifestyle with a blend of modern architecture, hospitality services, and world-class amenities.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 7.85 acres, the development features multiple high-rise towers planned in phases, offering a mix of studio apartments, 1 BHK serviced residences, and spacious 3 & 4 BHK luxury homes.\r\n\r\nThe project includes around 6 towers with limited units per floor, ensuring exclusivity and privacy. Select towers feature only 2 apartments per floor, enhancing the premium living experience.\r\n\r\nOne of its key highlights is an iconic skywalk connecting towers, offering panoramic views and a unique elevated lifestyle experience.\r\n\r\nCentral Park Delphine is designed with high-end specifications, spacious layouts, and large balconies, complemented by resort-style amenities such as clubhouse, infinity pool, wellness zones, concierge services, and landscaped greens.\r\n\r\nStrategically located on Dwarka Expressway, the project offers excellent connectivity to IGI Airport, NH-48, Cyber City, and Delhi, making it a strong investment opportunity in a rapidly appreciating corridor.\r\n\r\nConstruction is planned in phases, with full completion expected around 2032, positioning it as a long-term luxury investment.",
