      "description": "Conscient Parq is a premium residential development located in Sector 80, Gurugram, near NH-48, offering a blend of luxury living and natural surroundings near the Aravalli hills.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.5 acres, the project features 4 high-rise towers designed to provide a low-density and exclusive living environment.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments ranging from approximately 1945 sq. ft. to 2825 sq. ft., with modern layouts, large balconies, and premium specifications.\r\n\r\nConscient Parq emphasizes lifestyle and wellness with features like a skywalk, green podium, landscaped gardens, and over 30+ amenities, including a massive clubhouse (50,000–75,000 sq. ft.).\r\n\r\nThe project is strategically located with excellent connectivity to NH-48, Dwarka Expressway, and major business hubs, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.\r\n\r\nIt is currently under construction, with expected possession around 2028–2030, offering strong long-term investment potential.",
