      "metaDescription": "Explore Emaar Business District 65 offering premium SCO plots for retail & office use in Sector 65 Gurugram. Prime investment on Golf Course Extension Road.",
      "description": "Emaar Business District 65 (EBD 65) is a premium commercial development located in Sector 65, Gurugram, on the prime Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Emaar India, the project introduces a modern Shop-Cum-Office (SCO) concept designed for retail, office, and F&B businesses.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 5.7 acres, the project offers well-planned commercial plots with the flexibility to build basement + multiple floors, making it ideal for shops, offices, restaurants, and mixed-use developments.\r\n\r\nEBD 65 combines high-street retail with office spaces, creating a vibrant business hub surrounded by dense residential catchment, ensuring strong footfall and business visibility.\r\n\r\nThe development includes modern infrastructure such as wide internal roads, landscaped open spaces, organized parking, and pedestrian-friendly pathways.\r\n\r\nKey highlights include performance plaza, outdoor café zones, food truck areas, and interactive public spaces, making it a lifestyle-oriented commercial destination.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, EBD 65 offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, NH-48, Cyber City, and other major hubs, making it a high-potential investment opportunity in Gurugram’s commercial real estate market.",
