      "description": "Experion Windchants is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 112, Gurugram, along the prime Dwarka Expressway, offering seamless connectivity to Delhi and major business hubs.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 23 acres, the project is designed as a low-density premium township featuring apartments, duplex villaments, villas, and penthouses.\r\n\r\nThe project consists of around 7 high-rise towers with about 28 floors each, offering spacious residences designed for maximum natural light and ventilation.\r\n\r\nUnit sizes range from approximately 2441 sq. ft. to 8500+ sq. ft., catering to luxury homebuyers seeking large living spaces and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nA key highlight is Asia’s largest residential skywalk at the 7th level, connecting all towers and offering a unique elevated lifestyle experience.\r\n\r\nThe project offers over 2.5 lakh sq. ft. of activity and amenity space, including a grand clubhouse, swimming pools, sports courts, wellness zones, and landscaped greens.\r\n\r\nStrategically located near the Delhi border, Dwarka Expressway, and IGI Airport, Experion Windchants is a ready-to-move-in project, making it ideal for both end-users and investors.",
