      "description": "Experion The Heartsong is a premium residential project located in Sector 108, Gurugram, along the Dwarka Expressway, offering excellent connectivity to Delhi and IGI Airport.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 15 acres, the project is a well-planned gated community with over 80% open spaces, ensuring a green and peaceful living environment.\r\n\r\nThe development consists of around 15 towers with up to 14 floors each, offering 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK, and 5 BHK apartments along with penthouses.\r\n\r\nUnit sizes range from approximately 1283 sq. ft. to 4800+ sq. ft., designed with spacious layouts, large balconies, and premium fittings for comfortable living.\r\n\r\nDesigned by international architects, the project focuses on natural light, ventilation, and modern living, complemented by world-class amenities such as clubhouse, swimming pool, sports courts, spa, and landscaped greens.\r\n\r\nThe project is ready to move and offers a complete lifestyle with retail spaces, strong security systems, and community facilities, making it suitable for both end-users and investors.",
