      "metaDescription": "Explore Experion The Westerlies Sector 108 Gurugram offering premium residential plots & villas on Dwarka Expressway with world-class amenities.",
      "description": "Experion The Westerlies is a premium plotted township located in Sector 108, Gurugram, along the fast-developing Dwarka Expressway, offering excellent connectivity to Delhi and major NCR hubs.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 100 acres, the project is a fully integrated township designed with a focus on green living, open spaces, and modern infrastructure.\r\n\r\nThe development offers residential plots and villas with plot sizes ranging from approximately 181 sq. yd. to over 1200 sq. yd., allowing buyers the flexibility to build customized homes.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of the project is its extensive green planning, including over 10–13 acres of landscaped green boulevards and a 1.1 km long central green spine known as “The Breeze.”\r\n\r\nThe township features wide internal roads, modern water management systems, and dedicated zones for recreation, wellness, and community interaction.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy amenities such as clubhouse, swimming pool, jogging tracks, yoga zones, amphitheatre, kids’ play areas, and landscaped gardens, offering a balanced lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStrategically located just minutes from the Delhi border and IGI Airport, Experion The Westerlies offers strong investment potential due to its prime location on Dwarka Expressway and upcoming infrastructure developments.",
