      "metaDescription": "Explore Mahindra Luminare Sector 59 Gurugram offering ultra-luxury 3 & 4 BHK apartments with private lift lobby on Golf Course Extension Road.",
      "description": "Mahindra Luminare is an ultra-luxury residential project located in Sector 59, Gurugram, on the prestigious Golf Course Extension Road. Developed by Mahindra Lifespaces, the project is designed to offer exclusive and private living with world-class specifications.\r\n\r\nSpread across approximately 6.8 acres, the development features 3 high-rise towers with limited residences, ensuring low-density and premium living.\r\n\r\nThe project offers spacious 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartments ranging from approximately 2985 sq. ft. to 6085 sq. ft., designed with expansive layouts, large balconies, and high-end interiors.\r\n\r\nA key highlight of Mahindra Luminare is its private lift lobby concept, ensuring direct access to each residence and enhanced privacy.\r\n\r\nThe project also features premium amenities such as a luxury clubhouse, swimming pool, spa, gymnasium, sports courts, landscaped gardens, and wellness spaces.\r\n\r\nStrategically located, it offers excellent connectivity to Golf Course Road, NH-48, Sohna Road, and major hubs like Cyber City and IGI Airport, making it ideal for luxury homebuyers.",
