      "metaDescription": "Explore Three Sixty West Worli Mumbai offering ultra-luxury residences & Ritz-Carlton homes with sea views and world-class amenities.",
      "description": "Three Sixty West (360 West) is an ultra-luxury residential and hospitality development located in Worli, Mumbai, offering breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea and the city skyline. Developed by Oberoi Realty, the project is one of Mumbai’s most iconic landmarks.\r\n\r\nThe development consists of two high-rise towers — one housing The Ritz-Carlton Hotel and the other featuring premium branded residences managed by The Ritz-Carlton.\r\n\r\nThe residential tower offers expansive 3 BHK, 4 BHK, and duplex apartments, designed with world-class architecture, premium finishes, and floor-to-ceiling windows that provide panoramic sea views.\r\n\r\nUnit sizes range from approximately 3000 sq. ft. to over 7000 sq. ft., catering to ultra-high-net-worth individuals seeking exclusivity and luxury living.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy access to world-class amenities including private concierge services, infinity pool, spa, fine dining restaurants, luxury clubhouse, and dedicated hospitality services managed by The Ritz-Carlton.\r\n\r\nStrategically located in Worli, the project offers seamless connectivity to Bandra-Worli Sea Link, Lower Parel, Nariman Point, and major business districts, making it one of the most prestigious residential addresses in Mumbai.",
