      "description": "TARC Ishva is an ultra-luxury residential development located in Sector 63A, Gurgaon, along Golf Course Extension Road. Designed with a unique four-side open concept, the project offers low-density living with one apartment per floor and private lift access. Spread across approximately 7–10 acres, it features high-rise towers with panoramic views of the Aravalli hills. The residences are vastu-compliant, spacious, and equipped with premium interiors, wrap-around decks, and smart layouts. With a massive clubhouse, green landscapes, and world-class amenities, TARC Ishva delivers a premium lifestyle for modern urban families and investors.",
